🇷🇺🔹The Russian Ministry of Defense:

The Armed Forces of the Russian Federation have continued to deliver strikes against logistics centers and Ukrainian seaports used to support the Ukrainian Armed Forces.

Strike drones and high-precision air-based weapons have targeted the following in Kiev and the Kiev region:

➡️ A transport and logistics center called "Fim Service," whose warehouse facilities were used to store components for long-range "Flamingo" cruise missiles;

➡️A logistics center in the settlement of Kalinovka;

➡️An ammunition depot in the settlement of Milaya - LLC "Fire Point."

In addition, the following were hit:

➡️ At the port of "Izmail" - a refueling station and areas for unloading fuel and lubricants intended for the Ukrainian Armed Forces;

➡️At the port of "Nikolaev" - a marine transshipment terminal, logistics centers used for unloading and storing military cargo, 18 storage facilities with military equipment, and three storage facilities with fuel and lubricants.

