🇷🇺🇺🇸🇺🇦 Affordable Mass: Russia Preparing to Mass Produce "Dan-T" Munition by 2027

▪️According to Western sources, it is a ground/air launched missile with a range of 500 km and designed specifically for the "affordable mass" the US itself is struggling to achieve;

▪️Reports suggest an initial annual production of 10,000 next year;

▪️Dan-T represents a step up in terms of speed and stealth over the Geran-5 loitering munition, but being cheaper and more numerous than more advanced cruise missiles;

▪️Russia will continue to enjoy an advantage in military industrial production owed to purpose-driven state owned enterprises vs. US profit-driven corporations;

▪️Russia operates at approx. 10% the military spending of the US but outproduces the US anywhere between 3-10 times depending on the munition;
